            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "TxCin2"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was fast and easy to fix. I pan fried these. The onion soup flavor was fine and not too strong. They did not come out meatloafy either. This reminded me of a slugburger. These were generously sized burgers.",
            "datePublished": "2025-08-29T01:54:25.931Z"
          },
          {
