            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "memphisbaby"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have been using this recipe with hamburger for as long as i could cook! I would recommend using a egg instead of water, as it helps the meat stick together. Also, I like to add sauces to the mix to give it a moist flavor. ketchup, mustard, bbq sauce, A1, worcheshire (sp?); any of these help maintain a great juicy flavor.",
            "datePublished": "2009-05-19T13:03:08.610Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
